{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026BsARrV5dLM1793331928.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>土耳其旅遊勝地卡帕多基亞發生石柱倒塌事故，三人死亡，五人受傷。</p><p></p><p>事故後有救護車及救援人員趕到倒塌現場。格雷梅露天博物館附近，一個煙囪狀石柱周四崩塌，跌入人群聚集區域，當地早前有暴雨。而受雨雪和大風影響，卡帕多基亞熱氣球項目已暫停營運。</p><p></p><p>當地媒體報道，兩名死者是土耳其公民，而另一名死者則是法國公民。傷者包括一名法國兒童，另外四名傷者接受治療後已出院。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T05:05:52.670133+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T23:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:17.452692+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T05:00:03.755175+00:00","content_hash":"6c7415005de345ad1c183f1fe1a6bd360c95addf583a45b877f071ab3e1c70f1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T05:05:52.670133+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}